  "content": "\n\n<p>Это всего лишь небольшой модпак, ориентированный на мультиплеер и исследование мира, но и одиночная игра работает отлично!</p>\n<p>Кроме того, в некоторых модах будут доступны различные наборы приёмов, такие как:</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_25433641-b57e-4cd4-904c-83c43ca1a029.jpg\" alt=\"Автор: https://www.youtube.com/@thememesmeller\" width=\"225\" height=\"225\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Создано: <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@thememesmeller\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.youtube.com/@thememesmeller</a></p>\n<p>И</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_7e46b682-8040-4b7a-95f4-d6c618275145.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"846\" height=\"234\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Создано: <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/havnnek/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/members/havnnek/projects</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>В состав модпака входит Comes Alive Reborn, а также активирован TTS!<br>Arise Dungeons<br>Dungeons Crawl<br>Ice and Fire<br>Shifu<br>Uchicraftana<br>Minimap<br>и ESF: <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-stats\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-stats</a></p>\n<p>И многое другое!&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">EFS:</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">Это система эволюции ваших характеристик, таких как сила, ловкость, выносливость, жизненная сила, магия, мана и т. д.</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><img src=\"\" alt=\"\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><img src=\"\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">Структуры и подземелья для исследования!</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><img src=\"\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">Comes Alive Reborn!</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><img src=\"\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">Ice and Fire!</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><img src=\"\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">Мобы EEEAB:</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><img src=\"\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">Iron and Speebooks!</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><img src=\"\" alt=\"\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">Классическая система книг EF:</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><img src=\"\" alt=\"\" width=\"711\" height=\"237\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">С Sword Soaring и WOM!</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">И многое другое!</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>",
